    "title": "Career Opportunity Hotel Manager at Scootsy Holdings Services",
    "description": "If you're a passionate Hotel Manager with drive and ambition, Scootsy Holdings Services in Faridabad is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout Scootsy Holdings Services:\nScootsy Holdings Services is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n• Deliver exceptional guest experiences in line with brand standards\n• Handle guest complaints and resolve issues promptly\n• Ensure compliance with FSSAI, health, and safety regulations\n• Manage procurement of hotel supplies and control operating costs\n• Manage front office operations including check-in/check-out\n• Conduct regular guest satisfaction surveys and implement improvements\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Tech / B.E. in Computer Science or related discipline\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Barista Skills\n• Proficiency in OTA Management\n• Proficiency in Sommelier Skills\n• Proficiency in HACCP\n• Proficiency in Crisis Management\n• Proficiency in Opera PMS\n• Proficiency in Revenue Management\n• Proficiency in Housekeeping Standards\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Faridabad, Haryana, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Scootsy Holdings Services!",
